#: ../../docstring f04bbedeec3a464594499c0fca8223a4 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.apply_secondary_structure:1
msgid ""
"Detects and assigns secondary structure annotations ('H', 'E', '-') to "
"residues in this chain."
msgstr "このチェイン内の残基に対して二次構造注釈 ('H', 'E', '-') を検出し割り当てる。"

#: ../../docstring 85b28fb2c3c54b67842fd8d666c6395b of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.apply_secondary_structure:3
msgid "Modifications are applied in-place to residue groups."
msgstr "変更は残基グループにインプレースで適用される。"

#: ../../docstring 253b2d4b6fac488bb43c80b70e082e07 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.assign_charges:1
msgid ""
"Sequentially assigns partial charges from a sequence to all atoms in the "
"hierarchy."
msgstr "シーケンスからの部分電荷を階層内のすべての原子に順番に割り当てる。"

#: ../../docstring 7079358885034244a4fe62dda4d7792b of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.assign_charges:3
msgid "The number of values in `charges` must exactly match the total atom count."
msgstr "`charges` 内の値の数は、総原子数と正確に一致しなければならない。"

#: ../../docstring e8f6d9d7872945ce95a3ff1a87b509cf of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.assign_charges:5
msgid "An iterable of numerical charge values."
msgstr "数値電荷値のイテラブル。"

