msgstr "削除する子グループのキー。"

#: ../../docstring 08351fe9a998455d9553a796b4ce14aa
#: b0093525c8524c20ad0f552e0bd9929b of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.del_group:6
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.remove_group:6
msgid "The removed child group, or None if not found."
